---
title: Miso honey chicken
servings: 8
tags: [chicken, grill, quick]
time: 15 minutes
source: Miso Honey Chicken by Sommer Collier, A Spicy Perspective, https://www.aspicyperspective.com/miso-honey-chicken/
---

Heat a #grill{} to medium.

Whisk the @honey{1/2%cup}, @white miso{1/2%cup}, @toasted sesame oil{3%tbsp}
and @red pepper flakes{1/2%tsp}. Taste, and add a little @kosher salt{} only if
your miso is mild.

Lay the @chicken thighs{3-4%lb}(boneless, skinless; or breasts) on the grill and
brush the tops with half the glaze. Grill ~{5%minutes}.

Turn them, brush with the rest, and grill ~{5%minutes} more, until cooked
through to 165°F.

> In the oven instead: bake on a #rimmed baking sheet{} at 400°F
> ~{20-25%minutes}.
